# Allowlist: the build context is only what a Dockerfile stage COPYs. The bot stage takes
# LICENSE, NOTICE and src/; migrate takes the uv files (.python-version pins uv's Python),
# alembic.ini, migrations/, src/ and the two deploy scripts. Anything else in a local checkout
# (.pixi/, agent configs) stays out.
*
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
!scripts/__init__.py
!scripts/db.py
!scripts/cron.py

# Local secrets and artifacts inside the allowed directories.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/.venv
**/.*_cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.coverage
**/.DS_Store
